          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Terminator Armour" id="ec28-7579-7a08-fcd1" hidden="false">
              <description>Gain a 2+ Armour save and add +1 to Attacks. Also gain the ability to teleport onto the battle field using Deep Strike if the mission allows. The model may only consolidate after a close combat.</description>
